<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page privacy-settings qd-theme qd-profile"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="privacy-card"><view class="privacy-title">由你决定分享多少</view><view class="privacy-switch-row"><text>默认在海报中隐藏体重</text><switch color="#9a83dc" checked="{{!privacy.showPosterWeight}}" disabled="{{busy || !signedIn}}" bindchange="togglePoster"/></view><view class="privacy-switch-row"><text>参加公开坚持榜</text><switch color="#9a83dc" checked="{{privacy.publicRank}}" disabled="{{busy || !signedIn}}" bindchange="toggleRank"/></view><view class="privacy-switch-row"><text>参加公开减重榜</text><switch color="#9a83dc" checked="{{privacy.lossRank}}" disabled="{{busy || !signedIn}}" bindchange="toggleLoss"/></view><view class="privacy-help">小队成员默认仅看见昵称、头像与习惯打卡，不会公开具体体重、餐食照片或健康档案。</view><button wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="privacy-primary" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">登录后管理公开范围</button></view>
<view class="privacy-card"><view class="privacy-title">每日打卡提醒</view><view class="privacy-help">添加到手机日历，在你选定的时间提醒你减肥打卡。</view><view class="privacy-time-label">提醒时间</view><picker mode="time" value="{{reminderTime}}" bindchange="reminderTime"><view class="privacy-time-picker">每天 {{reminderTime}}<text>⌄</text></view></picker><button class="privacy-primary" bindtap="addCalendar" disabled="{{busy}}">添加到手机日历</button><view class="privacy-help">请在系统日历中确认保存。修改时间或关闭提醒，请到手机日历中操作；提醒方式以手机日历设置为准。</view></view>
<view class="privacy-card privacy-actions"><button class="privacy-action" bindtap="policy"><view class="privacy-shield"><image class="privacy-shield-icon" src="/images/profile/shield.svg"/></view><text class="privacy-action-label">隐私政策与授权管理</text><text>›</text></button><button class="privacy-action" bindtap="exportRecords" disabled="{{busy}}"><text class="privacy-action-label">导出我的健康记录</text><text>›</text></button><button class="privacy-action privacy-danger" bindtap="deleteRecords" disabled="{{busy}}"><text class="privacy-action-label">删除健康记录</text><text>›</text></button><button class="privacy-action privacy-danger" bindtap="deleteAccount" disabled="{{busy}}"><text class="privacy-action-label">申请注销账户</text><text>›</text></button></view>
<view class="privacy-bottom-note">♧　体重、身体数据与餐食照片仅用于已说明的服务用途。撤回授权后，可继续浏览基础内容。</view><button class="privacy-logout" wx:if="{{signedIn}}" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录</button></block></view>
